  "augment.mysticalagriculture.tilling_aoe_iv.description": "Increases Tilling AOE to 9x9 while sneaking.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.growth_accelerators.page.2": "The range of the Growth Accelerator is based on it being placed underneath the farmland. $(br2)$(l:https://blakesmods.com/wiki/mysticalagriculture/guides/speeding-up-crop-growth)Click here for a detailed guide on using Growth Accelerators.$()",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.sickles": "Sickles",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.sickles.page.1": "Sickles are used for harvesting/destroying large areas of plant material. $(br2)Higher tier Sickles will have a greater area of effect.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.scythes": "Scythes",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.scythes.page.1": "Scythes are used for harvesting large areas of crops by right clicking. Any fully grown crops within the area of effect will be harvested without being uprooted. $(br2)Scythes are also an effective weapon with an increased attack AOE. $(br2)Higher tier Scythes have a greater area of effect.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soulium_dagger.page.3": "The Passive Attuned Soulium Dagger provides an additional +50 percent souls gathered from passive mobs.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soulium_dagger.page.4": "The Hostile Attuned Soulium Dagger provides an additional +50 percent souls gathered from hostile mobs.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.experience_capsule": "Experience Capsule",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.experience_capsule.page.1": "Experience Capsules are used to collect experience for creating Experience Seeds. $(br2)To collect experience, simply have some Experience Capsules in your inventory and pick up Experience Orbs.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.enchanter": "Enchanter",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.enchanter.page.1": "The Enchanter is a block that allows you to enchant your tools and armor using different crafting materials and Experience Essence. $(br2)The Enchanter can apply enchantments to both Books and tools/armor, similarly to an Anvil.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.cognizant_dust": "Cognizant Dust",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.cognizant_dust.page.1": "Cognizant Dust is $(bold)usually$() obtained by killing a Wither or Ender Dragon using an $(l:tinkering/essence_tools)Essence Weapon$() enchanted with Mystical Enlightenment. $(br2)Higher levels of Mystical Enlightenment will increase the amount of dust dropped on kill.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.essence_vessel": "Essence Vessel",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.essence_vessel.page.1": "Essence Vessels are used in the $(l:elemental/awakening_altar)Awakening Altar$() structure to hold the elemental essences required to create items. Each vessel can hold up to 40 of a single elemental essence.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.awakening_altar": "Awakening Altar",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.awakening_altar.page.1": "The Awakening Altar is a crafting structure that is $(bold)usually$() used to create $(l:elemental/awakened_supremium)Awakened Supremium$(). The structure consists of 1 Infusion Altar, 4 Infusion Pedestals and 4 $(l:elemental/essence_vessel)Essence Vessels$(). $(br2)Once you have a recipe put in place, you just need to activate the altar with a Redstone signal.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.awakening_altar.page.3": "Placing the Awakening Altar in world will show you where to place your pedestals and vessels.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.awakened_supremium": "Awakened Supremium",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.awakened_supremium.page.1": "Awakened Supremium is a high level crafting material used to create upgraded versions of many of your Supremium items. $(br2)Awakened Supremium is $(bold)usually$() created by infusing $(l:elemental/cognizant_dust)Cognizant Dust$() with a Supremium Block using an $(l:elemental/awakening_altar)Awakening Altar$().",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.machine_upgrades": "Machine Upgrades",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.machine_upgrades.page.1": "Machine Upgrades can be placed in applicable machines to increase their effectiveness. $(br2)Higher tier machines will both use and generate power faster.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.essence_furnace": "Furnace",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.essence_furnace.page.1": "The basic furnace can be upgraded to take advantage of $(l:machines/machine_upgrades)Machine Upgrades$() for increased cooking speed. They run off of solid fuels and have an internal power storage buffer.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soul_extractor": "Soul Extractor",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soul_extractor.page.1": "Soul Extractors are used to convert mob drops into mob souls. They run off of solid fuels and have an internal power storage buffer. $(br2)The Soul Extractor provides a use for extra mob drops you may have, but generally won't be as efficient as using a $(l:souls/soulium_dagger)Soulium Dagger$().",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.harvester": "Harvester",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.harvester.page.1": "Harvesters are used to automatically harvest fully grown crops. They run off of solid fuels and have an internal power storage buffer. $(br2)The harvester will automatically re-plant the crops it harvests. $(br2)The harvester will place all resources into it's internal inventory. If there's no space, the items will be placed on the crop.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.harvester.page.2": "The Harvester will use a bit of power every time it checks a crop for growth. Harvesting fully grown crops uses an increased amount of power. $(br2)These machines can upgraded with $(l:machines/machine_upgrades)Machine Upgrades$(). $(br2)The Harvester can be de-activated with a Redstone signal.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soulium_spawner": "Soulium Spawner",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soulium_spawner.page.1": "The Soulium Spawner is used to spawn both hostile and passive mobs using Essences. They run off of solid fuels and have an internal power storage buffer. $(br2)The Spawner has an internal inventory that can hold up to 512 items. Each operation will take a certain amount of items and power to spawn a corresponding mob.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soulium_spawner.page.2": "The Spawner will spawn the mob randomly in a 3 block radius around it. $(br2)These machines can upgraded with $(l:machines/machine_upgrades)Machine Upgrades$(). $(br2)The Soulium Spawner can be de-activated with a Redstone signal.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.blindness_resistance_augment": "Blindness Resistance Augment",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.blindness_resistance_augment.page.1": "The Blindness Resistance Augment is a helmet augment that prevents the wearer from getting the Blindness effect while they have the armor equipped.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.hunger_resistance_augment": "Hunger Resistance Augment",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.hunger_resistance_augment.page.1": "The Hunger Resistance Augment is a helmet augment that prevents the wearer from getting the Hunger effect while they have the armor equipped.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.nausea_resistance_augment": "Nausea Resistance Augment",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.nausea_resistance_augment.page.1": "The Nausea Resistance Augment is a helmet augment that prevents the wearer from getting the Nausea effect while they have the armor equipped.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.slowness_resistance_augment": "Slowness Resistance Augment",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.slowness_resistance_augment.page.1": "The Slowness Resistance Augment is a leggings augment that prevents the wearer from getting the Slowness effect while they have the armor equipped.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.weakness_resistance_augment": "Weakness Resistance Augment",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.weakness_resistance_augment.page.1": "The Weakness Resistance Augment is a chestplate augment that prevents the wearer from getting the Weakness effect while they have the armor equipped.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.luck_augment": "Luck Augment",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.luck_augment.page.1": "The Luck Augment is an armor augment that improves loot drops from fishing or loot chests for the wearer while they have the armor equipped.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.haste_augment": "Haste Augment",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.haste_augment.page.1": "The Haste Augment is a chestplate augment that increases the wearer's mining speed while they have the armor equipped.",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.slow_falling_augment": "Slow Falling Augment",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.slow_falling_augment.page.1": "The Slow Falling Augment is a leggings augment that prevents the wearer from getting the Slowness effect while they have the armor equipped. $(br2)This effect can be negated by holding down the Shift key.",
  "block.mysticalagriculture.awakened_supremium_farmland": "Awakened Supremium Farmland",
